      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The peace you are seeking isn't found in giving up, but in the quiet understanding that your pain is a signal that something vital is broken and needs healing. Even when the spark feels extinguished, the house you are standing in is still yours, and the effort to keep it standing is a testament to the love you hold for the person you are becoming. There is a profound dignity in choosing to stay and rebuild, even when the materials seem scarce, because the person you are waiting to meet is still there, waiting for you to finally come home.",
